@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title PUT /api/workspace/v1/messenger/topic_summary_endpoints/[endpoint_uuid]
actor "The client ." as Client
participant "TopicSummaryEndpointController\nRestAlchemy" as API
database "Lines of the control plane of the summary\n+ encrypted accounting data" as DB
queue "Transactional outbox\n1 immutable task I 'm on event" as Outbox
participant "Background player\nThe control plane of the summaries" as Worker
Client -> API: PUT /api/workspace/v1/messenger/topic_summary_endpoints/{endpoint_uuid}
API -> DB: The start of the transaction; Permission + change
API -> DB: Add an unchanged internal record to transactional outbox
DB --> API: fixing the purified state
API --> Client: A successful public response
DB ->> Outbox: the recording is fixed
Outbox ->> Worker: immutable delivery_snapshot_event\n(outbox_event_uuid, registry scope)
Worker -> DB: apply the current state of planning/leasing
note over Worker
There is no public event line
There 's no dispatcher . WebSocket
The topic tasks remain exclusive and go from new posts to old ones
end note
@enduml
